<IDS_SUBHEADER_TEXT>Esiet sveicinâti %ProductName% %ProductVer% uzstâdîðanas programmâ</IDS_SUBHEADER_TEXT>
<IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_NEXT>&amp;Tâlâk &gt;</IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_NEXT>
<IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_BACK>&lt; &amp;Atpakaï</IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_BACK>
<IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_CANCEL>At&amp;celt</IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_CANCEL>
<IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_HELP>&amp;Palîdzîba</IDS_CTRL_BUTTON_HELP>
<IDS_CTRL_STATICTEXT_BODY>Esiet sveicinâti %ProductName% %ProductVer% uzstâdîðanas programmâ.

Mçs iesakâm aizvçrt visas programmas pirms turpinât darbu pie programmas uzstâdîðanas.

Ja jums ir palaistas citas programmas, nospiediet pogu Atcelt, aizveriet tâs un palaidiet uzstâdîðanas programmu no jauna.

Citâdi, spiediet Tâlâk, lai turpinâtu.
</IDS_CTRL_STATICTEXT_BODY>
<IDS_CTRL_HEADINGTEXT_BODY>Esiet sveicinâti</IDS_CTRL_HEADINGTEXT_BODY>
